{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます☾⋆ ࣪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮城県出身 21歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の山川宇衣（やまかわうい）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10/14(水)\n16th Single「愛MUST BE」をリリースいたしました⊹ ࣪ ˖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もSHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんにて\nパネル展示を開催していただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがとうございます🥲🥲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サインも書かせていただいたので、\nぜひわたしたちからの愛を受け取りに足を運んでみてください〜🫶🏻🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "相手への愛情って\n関係に自信がないとなかなか伝えられないものでもある気がしていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ、どんな時も真っ直ぐに愛を伝えられるみなさんのことが改めて大切です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんも、いつも変わらず愛を届けてくださってありがとうございます🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“愛が愛を生む”"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人を想い、人に想われることを想い"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "連鎖する愛への願いを込めたこの楽曲が、\nたくさんの愛が、みなさんのもとに届きますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｼﾞｬｼﾞｬﾝ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobpz9Bu9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケット撮影をした日の📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はメイクも衣装も\nかっこいいスタイリングにしていただいて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気分もなんだかかっこよく過ごせた1日でした⭐️😙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしも自分がかっこよく生まれていたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "言ってみたいと思うような\nかっこいいセリフってなんだろう…って考えて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一番に頭に浮かんだ言葉をブログのタイトルにしてみました🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…今時こんなセリフは、ちょっぴり時代遅れですか？\nときめいてもらえないですか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かっこいいって難しい、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもさ、こんなこと言えちゃうくらい\nかっこよかったら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一体どんな人生なんだろうねえ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾂｶﾂｶｰって風を切って\nものすごく背筋を伸ばして歩いたりしちゃうかもな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもでも、\n今世に生まれたわたしだって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いまでも身長170cmの夢を諦めてはいないので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（調子が良ければ160cm台が出るようになったんだよ！これはまだいけます）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心の片隅で、\nこっそりかっこいいを求めて生きていこうと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから、かっこいいときはかっこいいよって教えてあげてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとすごく喜びます⭐️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん、かっこいい以外にも\nたくさん良いところを見つけてもらえるように頑張ります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうか見守っていてくださいー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今週は楽曲披露の機会をたくさんいただきました🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "精一杯お届けします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またブログ書きます！写真も載せます〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🪽ういのはねやすめ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の羽休めにおすすめしたい曲は…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "aikoさんの「Do you think about me?」⊹ ࣪ ˖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日、なんて\n欲張りなことは言わないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱり伝えてもらえたら\nすごくすごくうれしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから、\nいつも待ってるよとだけ言っておこっと😗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobWLyg0i.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね💌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うい　#58通目"}], "source": "official"}